1
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,520
Run!

2
00:02:42,639 --> 00:02:43,639
Let's see you run!

3
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,000
I fucking lost again!

4
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,919
It's all your fault!

5
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,599
Still wanna run?

6
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,240
You mortgaged Chun Spa!

7
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:57,199
Everything is gone!

8
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,280
Please, just let me go!

9
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,400
You've still got this fucking face!

10
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,520
Let me go!

11
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,080
Let you go?

12
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:07,960
You're my cash cow.

13
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,639
As long as you behave,

14
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,560
there'll be plenty in it for you.

15
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,599
Xiaxia

16
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:27,439
Xiaxia

17
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:28,840
Hurry, get up.

18
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:37,599
Are you done hitting?

19
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,240
Stop! Stop it!

20
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:51,400
I was put up to it!

21
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,479
Stop it!

22
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:03,560
I'll be gentle.

23
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,319
You're not going to yell at me?

24
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,479
If yelling at you did any good,

25
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:14,719
I'd have yelled it in your ear a million times.

26
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,839
Sometimes you just have to hit a brick wall

27
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,000
before you turn back.

28
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,959
He said he loved me.

29
00:04:25,079 --> 00:04:26,279
I believed him.

30
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:29,560
He said he loved the way I used to be.

31
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,560
And I believed that too.

32
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,160
If you jump from here,

33
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,199
you won't die.

34
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,160
It's too low.

35
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,279
You have to jump from there.

36
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,879
The 31st floor.

37
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:04,800
It only takes five seconds

38
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:07,160
for your body to hit the ground.

39
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:08,160
Splat.

40
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:10,639
And you're dead.

41
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:16,519
Mind your own business.

42
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,040
Go away.

43
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,839
Why don't you tell me to keep living?

44
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,040
In this world,

45
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:37,720
is there anything worth staying for?

46
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,560
You're not afraid to die.

47
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,759
So why be afraid to live?

48
00:05:43,439 --> 00:05:44,519
Together,

49
00:05:46,439 --> 00:05:47,399
we either die,

50
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:49,000
or we live.

51
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,480
Dare to try?

52
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,600
Look.

53
00:06:11,639 --> 00:06:13,240
You got it back for me.

54
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,639
Can I start over?

55
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:20,600
Can I?

56
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,040
Luoluo,

57
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:28,360
can I finally start over?

58
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,240
It's okay.

59
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,480
It's all in the past now.

60
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,000
I'll be right here with you.

61
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:37,639
I'll do exactly as you said.

62
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,399
As long as you let me off the hook.

63
00:06:42,079 --> 00:06:42,720
Get lost.

64
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,839
You're quite kind, Mr. An.

65
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,800
Letting him walk away just like that.

66
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,199
Gambling,

67
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:56,480
illegal imprisonment,

68
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,720
and intentional assault.

69
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,160
He's already broken the law.

70
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:01,759
Even if we let him go,

71
00:07:02,319 --> 00:07:03,560
the law won't.

72
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,639
Someone like you, Mr. An,

73
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,519
a pampered young master,

74
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:10,319
should stick to playing the young master.

75
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:12,040
Tough games like this

76
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,720
aren't for you.

77
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:23,279
I might not like

78
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,360
what you had to say,

79
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,600
but,

80
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,279
for what happened this time,

81
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:29,279
I still need to thank you.

82
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,279
No need.

83
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,519
I did it for Sang Luo.

84
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:34,560
You

85
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:36,360
have no right to thank me.

86
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:40,600
Fine.

87
00:07:45,639 --> 00:07:46,439
About Luo Xia,

88
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,360
thank you.

89
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:49,199
Between you and me,

90
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,560
there's no need for thanks.

91
00:07:59,079 --> 00:08:00,160
What's wrong?

92
00:08:01,079 --> 00:08:02,120
Nothing.

93
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,360
I'm fine.

94
00:08:06,519 --> 00:08:07,319
Are you okay?

95
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:09,240
I'm fine.

96
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,480
I'm glad you're okay.

97
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:12,879
Okay.

98
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,279
That's good.

99
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,800
Sang Luo, do you remember

100
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:19,519
the first time we met?

101
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,839
I remember.

102
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:26,199
I was dying back then.

103
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,279
Yeah.

104
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,000
You were on your last breath.

105
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,600
The look in your eyes back then,

106
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:36,799
I'll never forget it.

107
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:15,639
She's still alive.

108
00:09:30,519 --> 00:09:32,360
Help me.

109
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:38,320
Help me!

110
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:45,600
If it weren't for you,

111
00:09:45,799 --> 00:09:47,080
I'd be dead by now.

112
00:09:47,759 --> 00:09:49,279
So I owe you my life.

113
00:09:52,559 --> 00:09:53,799
I'll always be by your side,

114
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:56,320
and help you get back everything you want.

115
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:00,559
Since you know the Cheng family is a swamp,

116
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,320
then be careful.

117
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,440
Did I do something wrong?

118
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:14,879
You still have me.

119
00:10:16,679 --> 00:10:17,879
The dirty work you don't want to do,

120
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:19,879
I'll do it.

121
00:10:20,879 --> 00:10:21,679
No.

122
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:24,960
These photos absolutely cannot be leaked.

123
00:10:25,159 --> 00:10:26,240
Do you still want revenge?

124
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:28,679
For the past three years, you've constantly

125
00:10:28,679 --> 00:10:30,080
been thinking about revenge.

126
00:10:30,679 --> 00:10:32,120
How come as soon as you're back with Cheng An,

127
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,039
you start worrying about all this?

128
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,879
Let go.

129
00:10:37,919 --> 00:10:38,840
I told you to let go!

130
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:41,600
You failed to protect her three years ago.

131
00:10:42,159 --> 00:10:43,759
You're the one who lost her once.

132
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,399
You have no right to stand by her side anymore.

133
00:10:48,399 --> 00:10:49,960
I'm asking you why.

134
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:54,879
Even without Cheng An,

135
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:56,480
we still wouldn't end up together.

136
00:10:58,080 --> 00:11:00,559
Because we were never meant for each other.

137
00:11:01,519 --> 00:11:02,399
Leave Sang Luo.

138
00:11:03,399 --> 00:11:04,679
As long as you can do that,

139
00:11:05,279 --> 00:11:07,159
all the shares I hold will be yours.

140
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:16,879
How about it?

141
00:11:17,919 --> 00:11:18,720
Made up your mind?

142
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,200
You're not coming back to Korea with me?

143
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,159
No.

144
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,600
You win.

145
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,360
I have a gift for you.

146
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:48,639
Gufeng Group

147
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,080
Share Transfer Agreement.

148
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,000
Thank you,

149
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,039
Yi Kai.

150
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,039
Call it my despicable selfishness.

151
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,039
I want you to never

152
00:12:01,559 --> 00:12:02,720
forget me for the rest of your life.

153
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,039
And you.

154
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,120
Take good care of her.

155
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,360
Don't give me an opening.

156
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,759
Alright.

157
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:16,639
I'm leaving.

158
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:25,000
I should've stayed by your side to protect you,

159
00:12:25,799 --> 00:12:26,600
instead of

160
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:29,159
letting you endure all this pain alone.

161
00:12:31,039 --> 00:12:32,799
Isn't it fine the way it is now?

162
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,080
After everything we've been through,

163
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,759
I cherish our happiness now even more.

164
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:42,120
The point is, we're still together.

165
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,840
And we'll never be apart.

166
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:45,759
Yeah.

167
00:12:47,039 --> 00:12:47,840
Never.

168
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,519
Rest assured,

169
00:12:52,559 --> 00:12:54,799
I'll spend the rest of my life protecting you.

170
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,519
I won't let you suffer the slightest harm.

171
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,799
Everyone,

172
00:13:25,159 --> 00:13:26,679
today's agenda is very important.

173
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,240
We need to select a contestant

174
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,720
to represent Gufeng

175
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:30,840
in

176
00:13:30,879 --> 00:13:32,759
the triennial wine competition.

177
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,639
Every shareholder

178
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:35,279
can nominate one contestant.

179
00:13:35,799 --> 00:13:37,279
Let's hear your opinions.

180
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:38,919
I think

181
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,639
in the last wine competition,

182
00:13:41,039 --> 00:13:42,000
our Director Lin

183
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:42,960
used "Evening Breeze"

184
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,639
to put Gufeng on the map.

185
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,919
So this time,

186
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,200
she is determined to win.

187
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:52,080
I'm willing to represent Gufeng.

188
00:13:53,879 --> 00:13:54,679
I recommend

189
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,919
Kista to compete.

190
00:13:57,919 --> 00:13:58,720
Mr. Cheng,

191
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,480
as far as I know,

192
00:14:00,679 --> 00:14:01,480
this Kista

193
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:03,559
is Sang Luo from R&D, right?

194
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,559
This youngster

195
00:14:05,759 --> 00:14:07,960
asked Purchasing for a huge sum

196
00:14:08,639 --> 00:14:10,679
to buy a patented fermentation technology.

197
00:14:10,759 --> 00:14:11,799
But in the end,

198
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:12,919
the technology was flawed,

199
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,519
and all the fermented wine was ruined.

200
00:14:14,799 --> 00:14:15,919
You want someone like her

201
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:18,080
to represent Gufeng in such a major event?

202
00:14:18,399 --> 00:14:19,799
I'll be the first to object.

203
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,799
Sang Luo did make a mistake.

204
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,000
However,

205
00:14:23,399 --> 00:14:24,960
the profits she has brought to Gufeng

206
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:26,480
far outweigh that one error.

207
00:14:28,919 --> 00:14:29,759
This is Laijin Winery's

208
00:14:29,759 --> 00:14:31,399
sales report for the past three months.

209
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,600
Please pass it around.

210
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,440
The top five wines on the list

211
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,480
were all made by Kista.

212
00:14:38,639 --> 00:14:39,799
Although she lacks experience

213
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:42,320
and mishandled some tasks,

214
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:43,759
still,

215
00:14:43,919 --> 00:14:45,240
her winemaking skills

216
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,480
have earned the attention of

217
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,080
many wineries, home and abroad.

218
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:49,799
Many people even travel here specifically

219
00:14:49,799 --> 00:14:51,320
just to order her custom wines.

220
00:14:52,159 --> 00:14:52,960
Therefore,

221
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,039
her winemaking ability

222
00:14:54,159 --> 00:14:55,360
is unquestionable.

223
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:00,960
Since

224
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:02,720
we can't reach an agreement,

225
00:15:03,159 --> 00:15:03,879
I suggest

226
00:15:03,879 --> 00:15:05,039
one vote per shareholder.

227
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:06,919
A vote is

228
00:15:07,039 --> 00:15:07,879
the fairest

229
00:15:07,879 --> 00:15:08,480
and most impartial way

230
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:10,000
to select the contestant.

231
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:21,799
Everyone,

232
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,559
I'll announce the voting results.

233
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,039
It's a tie.

234
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,320
I didn't expect

235
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,440
Gufeng to have so many

236
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:32,120
people siding with outsiders.

237
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,759
I vote for myself.

238
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,240
Sang Luo,

239
00:15:41,519 --> 00:15:43,080
are you kidding me?

240
00:15:43,279 --> 00:15:44,000
Only shareholders

241
00:15:44,159 --> 00:15:45,919
have the right to vote.

242
00:15:49,279 --> 00:15:51,279
This is my share certificate.

243
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:53,639
Shares?

244
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:56,559
My shares in Gufeng are now equal to yours.

245
00:15:56,559 --> 00:15:58,399
Tell me, do I have the right to vote?

246
00:15:59,679 --> 00:16:00,480
Lin Wanmei,

247
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,240
you can't escape.

248
00:16:02,919 --> 00:16:04,879
See you at the wine competition.

249
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,519
Wanmei...

250
00:16:19,679 --> 00:16:20,519
What's wrong?

251
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:23,879
That bitch Ye Xiaowei...

252
00:16:23,919 --> 00:16:25,639
She stole my spot in the competition!

253
00:16:25,799 --> 00:16:26,919
You can leave Gufeng

254
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,480
and enter the competition independently.

255
00:16:32,159 --> 00:16:32,960
Wanmei,

256
00:16:34,559 --> 00:16:35,480
tell me.

257
00:16:36,039 --> 00:16:37,720
Are you actually worried about the spot,

258
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,639
or that you can't beat Ye Xiaowei?

259
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,519
I can lose to anyone else,

260
00:16:42,879 --> 00:16:44,840
but I absolutely cannot lose to Ye Xiaowei.

261
00:16:55,799 --> 00:16:56,799
Here, Mr. Guo

262
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,759
About the contest slot this time,

263
00:16:58,759 --> 00:16:59,879
I'm counting on you.

264
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:01,480
Then let me congratulate you in advance,

265
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,679
on taking first place, Ms. Lin.

266
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,079
Thank you.

267
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:11,079
I've also prepared

268
00:17:11,079 --> 00:17:12,119
a special show for you today.

269
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:13,440
I hope you'll like it.

270
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,039
Xiaxia.

271
00:17:21,319 --> 00:17:22,400
Long time no see.

272
00:17:22,759 --> 00:17:23,799
Help me out today.

273
00:17:24,839 --> 00:17:25,960
I've brought her here.

274
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,279
I'm leaving now.

275
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,400
Come on, Xiaxia.

276
00:17:32,839 --> 00:17:33,640
Mr. Guo,

277
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,920
let me introduce you.

278
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:35,920
This is my dear sister,

279
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:36,640
Xiaxia.

280
00:17:36,759 --> 00:17:37,640
This is Mr. Guo.

281
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,319
Xiaxia,

282
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:39,039
sit down.

283
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,720
Ms. Lin is so beautiful.

284
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,640
I didn't expect your sister

285
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:42,960
to be quite a stunner too.

286
00:17:44,519 --> 00:17:45,240
Come on.

287
00:17:45,319 --> 00:17:46,319
Drink up.

288
00:17:53,039 --> 00:17:54,599
Mr. Guo is a friend.

289
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:55,039
No.

290
00:17:55,039 --> 00:17:55,680
Just have a drink with him.

291
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:56,960
Let go of me, Mr. Guo.

292
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:58,119
I'm going to the restroom.

293
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,680
Let go. Don't be scared, sweetheart.

294
00:18:00,839 --> 00:18:01,599
What are you doing here?

295
00:18:02,039 --> 00:18:02,680
Who are you?

296
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,519
How did you get in?

297
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:04,759
Who are you?

298
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:05,960
How did you...

299
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,880
It was her.

300
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:10,880
It was Lin Wanmei.

301
00:18:11,079 --> 00:18:12,039
She paid me

302
00:18:12,039 --> 00:18:13,279
to write the recommendation letter,

303
00:18:13,359 --> 00:18:14,960
so she could enter the wine contest.

304
00:18:15,519 --> 00:18:16,960
Wan Niang was sent by her.

305
00:18:17,319 --> 00:18:18,799
Chu Yan was acting on her orders too.

306
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:19,599
Shut your mouth!

307
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:22,519
It was all Lin Wanmei.

308
00:18:22,519 --> 00:18:24,160
Lin Wanmei coerced and threatened me.

309
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,920
She even sold my shop.

310
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,559
She also teamed up with my boyfriend

311
00:18:27,759 --> 00:18:28,920
to ruin me.

312
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,039
Stop filming!

313
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:35,559
This is for those girls

314
00:18:35,559 --> 00:18:37,640
whose lives you ruined.

315
00:18:38,839 --> 00:18:40,440
They're all in hell now.

316
00:18:41,119 --> 00:18:42,720
Why should you get to live a good life?

317
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:43,480
Ye Xiaowei.

318
00:18:43,599 --> 00:18:45,279
I'm Cheng An, CEO of Gufeng.

319
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,519
Gufeng Group

320
00:18:46,559 --> 00:18:48,400
was smeared over what happened before.

321
00:18:48,559 --> 00:18:49,319
So

322
00:18:49,519 --> 00:18:51,079
I need to find the truth.

323
00:18:51,599 --> 00:18:52,400
Lin Wanmei,

324
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:54,000
all these dirty deeds of yours

325
00:18:54,319 --> 00:18:55,920
are being livestreamed now.

326
00:18:59,319 --> 00:19:00,759
What a crazy twist!

327
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:01,720
Waiting for updates.

328
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,319
This is shocking.

329
00:19:02,599 --> 00:19:03,640
Is this industry really this shady?

330
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:04,839
Stop reading.

331
00:19:04,839 --> 00:19:05,960
These nasty online comments

332
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:07,319
aren't worth taking to heart.

333
00:19:09,599 --> 00:19:11,160
You really think I care about this?

334
00:19:11,759 --> 00:19:13,519
They're just throwing a few insults.

335
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,039
People like them

336
00:19:15,079 --> 00:19:17,680
only dare to hide behind their screens.

337
00:19:17,799 --> 00:19:18,599
In reality,

338
00:19:18,599 --> 00:19:19,319
they're just a bunch of

339
00:19:19,319 --> 00:19:20,640
fools led by public opinion,

340
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,920
just spineless fence-sitters.

341
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:23,720
Watch this.

342
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:24,519
Open it.

343
00:19:25,599 --> 00:19:26,079
Okay.

344
00:19:30,279 --> 00:19:31,440
You guys don't know?

345
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:32,680
This Gufeng executive

346
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,720
is actually a fruit farmer's daughter from Taojia Village.

347
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:36,599
She grew up working in the vineyards.

348
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:38,039
Who knows what tricks she used

349
00:19:38,039 --> 00:19:39,359
to package herself as

350
00:19:39,359 --> 00:19:41,200
someone from a French wine-making family,

351
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,440
a wealthy heiress.

352
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:44,400
Her name isn't Lin Wanmei either.

353
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:45,759
Her real name

354
00:19:45,839 --> 00:19:46,920
is actually Lin Xiaomei.

355
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:47,759
Holy crap.

356
00:19:48,039 --> 00:19:49,519
I've seen photos of her at events.

357
00:19:49,519 --> 00:19:50,720
She looked so arrogant.

358
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,039
I thought she was real nobility.

359
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:54,200
Lin Xiaomei.

360
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:56,039
What a tacky name.

361
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:59,079
A classmate of our security guard's daughter-in-law

362
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,440
is from this Taojia Village.

363
00:20:00,839 --> 00:20:02,240
People from that place...

364
00:20:02,759 --> 00:20:05,240
Harsh lands really do breed unruly people.

365
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:07,200
You shouldn't say that.

366
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,960
There are good and bad people everywhere.

367
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:09,920
It's just that this Lin Xiaomei...

368
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:11,079
Lin Xiaomei

369
00:20:11,079 --> 00:20:11,960
is truly despicable.

370
00:20:13,279 --> 00:20:14,240
These are all lies!

371
00:20:16,079 --> 00:20:17,880
You only need to know my name is Lin Wanmei.

372
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:20,440
I was born in Riquewihr, France.

373
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:22,599
My parents went to France in the 70s.

374
00:20:22,839 --> 00:20:24,319
I am their only daughter.

375
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:26,000
I graduated from the University of Reims in France.

376
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,000
Our Lin family in France

377
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,599
even has its own vineyard.

378
00:20:28,599 --> 00:20:29,440
I am not some

379
00:20:29,519 --> 00:20:30,319
fruit farmer's daughter!

380
00:20:30,519 --> 00:20:31,200
I'm not.

381
00:20:31,559 --> 00:20:32,200
I'm not.

382
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:33,279
I'm not!

383
00:20:33,599 --> 00:20:34,279
It's alright.

384
00:20:35,759 --> 00:20:36,240
It's okay.

385
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:38,319
It's going to be okay.

386
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,720
After discussion among Gufeng's senior management,

387
00:20:43,759 --> 00:20:44,759
we have unanimously decided

388
00:20:45,279 --> 00:20:47,480
to revoke Lin Wanmei's proxy shareholding rights.

389
00:20:48,079 --> 00:20:49,200
You called me here

390
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,960
just for this?

391
00:20:51,039 --> 00:20:52,559
Given your fabricated identity

392
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,799
and the series of news reports

393
00:20:54,960 --> 00:20:57,000
that have caused massive losses for Gufeng,

394
00:20:57,279 --> 00:20:58,400
the company has decided

395
00:20:58,599 --> 00:21:00,480
to terminate your employment contract.

396
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,839
Major shake-up at Gufeng Group

397
00:21:28,839 --> 00:21:30,480
Lin Wanmei dismissed

398
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:31,279
Reportedly,

399
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:33,559
Lin Wanmei was involved in multiple illegal activities.

400
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:46,759
Auntie Ying

401
00:21:51,599 --> 00:21:52,640
Auntie Hong

402
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:54,480
Ruolin

403
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:56,359
Cheng Yan

404
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:58,160
Where the hell did you all go?

405
00:21:59,759 --> 00:22:00,559
Sang Luo

406
00:22:01,359 --> 00:22:03,000
Cheng An

407
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:07,359
Where are you?

408
00:22:10,599 --> 00:22:11,400
Grandma.

409
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:12,920
They all left.

410
00:22:13,519 --> 00:22:14,480
What do you need?

411
00:22:30,119 --> 00:22:31,359
Nothing, Grandma.

412
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:32,559
I'm just borrowing this

413
00:22:32,839 --> 00:22:34,359
to adjust your glasses.

414
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,240
Give it to me.

415
00:22:57,799 --> 00:22:58,880
In the end...

416
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:01,400
I couldn't hold onto anything.

417
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:17,119
Lin Wanmei

418
00:23:17,279 --> 00:23:18,559
Look at you now.

419
00:23:20,880 --> 00:23:22,359
This whole family of yours...

420
00:23:22,759 --> 00:23:24,200
It's truly ironic.

421
00:23:24,519 --> 00:23:25,839
A fake heiress

422
00:23:26,440 --> 00:23:29,200
scheming so hard to marry into a fake wealthy family.

423
00:23:31,279 --> 00:23:32,880
Always bragging about

424
00:23:32,960 --> 00:23:34,039
being of noble descent,

425
00:23:34,039 --> 00:23:35,200
having royal blood...

426
00:23:35,839 --> 00:23:37,400
when your ancestor was nothing but

427
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:39,440
a foot-washing maid for a princess.

428
00:23:41,079 --> 00:23:42,279
Sure enough.

429
00:23:42,279 --> 00:23:43,079
People...

430
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,799
the more they lack something,

431
00:23:45,079 --> 00:23:46,599
the more they obsess over it.

432
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:47,599
Nonsense!

433
00:23:48,319 --> 00:23:49,960
My ancestors

434
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:51,920
were indeed from a prestigious family!

435
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:52,680
Bullshit!

436
00:23:53,319 --> 00:23:54,279
The Cheng family?

437
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,000
A wealthy family?

438
00:23:56,599 --> 00:23:57,400
My ass!

439
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,799
My daughter Xiaoyan

440
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:03,440
is finally avenged!

441
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:07,400
I never have to grovel here again

442
00:24:07,559 --> 00:24:09,319
and play along with your charade!

443
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:13,039
Grandma!

444
00:24:13,319 --> 00:24:14,079
Grandma!

445
00:24:18,440 --> 00:24:19,200
Grandma!

446
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:20,759
Grandma!

447
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:35,200
Please don't be mad.

448
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:35,960
Leaving Gufeng

449
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:37,319
might not be a bad thing.

450
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:38,319
In the future,

451
00:24:38,559 --> 00:24:40,240
you'll have more chances to show your skills.

452
00:24:41,759 --> 00:24:43,200
I worked so hard for so many years,

453
00:24:43,559 --> 00:24:45,000
and now I have nothing.

454
00:24:48,039 --> 00:24:48,839
Stop drinking.

455
00:24:50,079 --> 00:24:51,039
You naturally run cold.

456
00:24:51,440 --> 00:24:52,680
Let me make you some red ginseng water.

457
00:24:54,119 --> 00:24:55,200
That was made by Auntie Hong.

458
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:56,319
It's all gone.

459
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:03,680
Madam,

460
00:25:04,279 --> 00:25:05,839
do you have time to meet?

461
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:14,519
Auntie Hong.

462
00:25:15,680 --> 00:25:16,519
You wanted to see me?

463
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:18,279
Madam.

464
00:25:19,079 --> 00:25:20,680
I've already left the Cheng family,

465
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,480
but since I used to serve you,

466
00:25:22,559 --> 00:25:25,119
I kept thinking about your cold hands and feet.

467
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,960
You must be out of red ginseng paste by now.

468
00:25:27,119 --> 00:25:28,960
So I brought some more for you.

469
00:25:29,279 --> 00:25:30,079
Here.

470
00:25:30,559 --> 00:25:31,759
Try it while it's hot.

471
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,000
See if my cooking skills

472
00:25:34,319 --> 00:25:35,400
have gotten rusty.

473
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,160
Thank you, Auntie Hong.

474
00:25:41,599 --> 00:25:42,799
It tastes exactly the same.

475
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:44,200
Auntie Hong,

476
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,960
what are your plans now?

477
00:25:46,119 --> 00:25:46,920
How about

478
00:25:47,640 --> 00:25:48,839
I hire you myself?

479
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:52,920
My goal

480
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:54,240
has already been achieved.

481
00:25:54,559 --> 00:25:55,480
What goal?

482
00:25:55,559 --> 00:25:56,440
Didn't you

483
00:25:56,480 --> 00:25:58,680
always think the gifts Yanyan gave you

484
00:25:58,799 --> 00:26:00,200
weren't presentable enough?

485
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:02,680
It's the exact same red ginseng paste,

486
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,160
I just put it in

487
00:26:04,160 --> 00:26:05,359
some pretty packaging,

488
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:07,079
and you couldn't get enough of it.

489
00:26:07,519 --> 00:26:08,640
Who's Yanyan?

490
00:26:09,079 --> 00:26:09,799
Ms. Lin,

491
00:26:10,240 --> 00:26:11,000
this is my mother's

492
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,640
handmade longan red ginseng paste.

493
00:26:12,759 --> 00:26:14,039
It has no weird additives

494
00:26:14,319 --> 00:26:16,240
and works great for cold hands and feet.

495
00:26:16,400 --> 00:26:17,200
Give it a try.

496
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,359
You mean Chu Yan?

497
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:21,160
Since you couldn't accept Yanyan's kindness,

498
00:26:21,359 --> 00:26:23,839
then swallow a mother's hatred and pain!

499
00:26:24,839 --> 00:26:25,839
You still don't know

500
00:26:25,960 --> 00:26:27,720
what exactly was in the red ginseng paste

501
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:29,440
you've been drinking for so long, do you?

502
00:26:48,519 --> 00:26:49,319
With such a perfect opportunity,

503
00:26:49,319 --> 00:26:50,720
you should've just poisoned me.

504
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:53,440
Such dirty tricks

505
00:26:53,599 --> 00:26:54,759
are beneath even a dog.

506
00:27:07,720 --> 00:27:08,759
What are you thinking about?

507
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,599
My eldest brother is gone.

508
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:13,240
Cheng Yan...

509
00:27:13,839 --> 00:27:15,559
Cheng Ruolin has been sent away.

510
00:27:16,279 --> 00:27:17,200
Lin Wanmei

511
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,480
has also left Gufeng.

512
00:27:20,119 --> 00:27:21,319
Gufeng and the Cheng family

513
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:24,599
are just an empty shell now.

514
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:28,200
I originally wanted to avenge my mother.

515
00:27:30,359 --> 00:27:31,319
But,

516
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:33,839
Fang Liangxi is in the hospital now,

517
00:27:33,880 --> 00:27:34,960
her fate unknown.

518
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,559
I don't know what to do anymore.

519
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:44,519
In South Korea,

520
00:27:44,759 --> 00:27:47,039
during those three years I was framed by Lin Wanmei,

521
00:27:48,039 --> 00:27:49,960
hatred was all that kept me going.

522
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,640
I always thought

523
00:27:54,079 --> 00:27:56,279
that only by returning the pain

524
00:27:56,279 --> 00:27:57,440
they inflicted on me,

525
00:27:58,359 --> 00:27:59,720
could I find redemption.

526
00:28:00,759 --> 00:28:03,160
But this process brought me no joy.

527
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:07,359
I even lost myself at one point,

528
00:28:12,359 --> 00:28:13,680
unable to tell

529
00:28:14,759 --> 00:28:16,200
if I was truly Ye Xiaowei

530
00:28:16,200 --> 00:28:17,519
or Sang Luo.

531
00:28:18,759 --> 00:28:20,160
Luckily, I had you,

532
00:28:20,720 --> 00:28:22,240
and I managed to find myself again.

533
00:28:23,799 --> 00:28:25,440
So, Cheng An,

534
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:28,400
I won't tell you to let go of your hatred.

535
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:30,599
No matter what you do,

536
00:28:30,599 --> 00:28:32,000
I'll support you.

537
00:28:35,119 --> 00:28:37,559
But I don't want you to suffer like I did.

538
00:28:38,039 --> 00:28:39,559
I want you to be happy.

539
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:19,000
Are you here to see if I'm dead yet?

540
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:21,000
Of course not, Mom.

541
00:29:22,359 --> 00:29:24,079
We've been mother and daughter-in-law for years.

542
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:26,559
I want you to get well soon too.

543
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:27,920
Mother and daughter-in-law?

544
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:30,920
But deep down,

545
00:29:31,279 --> 00:29:33,400
I've never accepted you.

546
00:29:39,759 --> 00:29:40,839
This bracelet

547
00:29:41,519 --> 00:29:43,079
was given to me when I got married

548
00:29:43,759 --> 00:29:45,240
by my mother.

549
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:47,839
A fruit farmer's daughter like you

550
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:52,240
doesn't deserve to wear it.

551
00:29:52,279 --> 00:29:53,079
Mom.

552
00:29:53,599 --> 00:29:54,839
Look at the state you're in,

553
00:29:54,839 --> 00:29:56,039
yet you're still talking tough.

554
00:29:56,559 --> 00:29:58,160
Aren't you afraid I'll get mad

555
00:29:58,160 --> 00:29:59,519
and pull your oxygen tube?

556
00:30:00,279 --> 00:30:01,119
Come on!

557
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,039
Pull it!

558
00:30:14,960 --> 00:30:15,799
I'm here today

559
00:30:17,480 --> 00:30:19,440
mainly to make a deal with you.

560
00:30:19,799 --> 00:30:20,960
Looking at your condition,

561
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,599
you don't have much time left.

562
00:30:23,920 --> 00:30:24,799
So,

563
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:27,559
just consider my proposal.

564
00:30:28,839 --> 00:30:29,839
Impossible.

565
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:32,160
Even as a ghost,

566
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:35,480
I will never let you off!

567
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:44,720
Cheng An already knows his true identity.

568
00:30:45,799 --> 00:30:47,880
Aren't you afraid that to get back at the Cheng family,

569
00:30:48,559 --> 00:30:50,480
he'll hand Gufeng over to the An family?

570
00:30:51,279 --> 00:30:52,240
If that happens,

571
00:30:52,680 --> 00:30:54,839
Old Master Cheng and Cheng Feng's life's work

572
00:30:55,359 --> 00:30:57,400
will end up benefiting someone else.

573
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:03,160
Look at the Cheng family now.

574
00:31:04,799 --> 00:31:06,559
There's only you and Xie Dongdong left,

575
00:31:06,559 --> 00:31:07,960
just the old and the sick.

576
00:31:08,519 --> 00:31:10,039
Who else can you count on?

577
00:31:10,519 --> 00:31:12,400
Sang Luo is a fraud.

578
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,319
Cheng Ruolin, Cheng Yan...

579
00:31:14,319 --> 00:31:15,200
They never get anything right,

580
00:31:15,200 --> 00:31:16,279
but always ruin everything.

581
00:31:16,799 --> 00:31:17,599
Mom,

582
00:31:18,519 --> 00:31:20,519
I'm the only one you can count on.

583
00:31:26,839 --> 00:31:28,599
I can cooperate with you,

584
00:31:29,880 --> 00:31:31,519
but you have to promise me,

585
00:31:32,759 --> 00:31:35,319
you must make Cheng An suffer.

586
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:38,839
Don't worry.

587
00:31:39,519 --> 00:31:41,319
I'll definitely protect the Cheng family for you,

588
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:43,000
and protect Gufeng.

589
00:31:52,319 --> 00:31:54,039
Remember your promise.

590
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,559
Protect the Cheng family.

591
00:31:55,759 --> 00:31:57,039
Protect Gufeng.

592
00:31:57,640 --> 00:31:59,720
It's my Feng's life's work.

593
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:01,720
This secret today

594
00:32:01,839 --> 00:32:03,160
will be kept strictly

595
00:32:03,279 --> 00:32:04,079
between you

596
00:32:04,319 --> 00:32:05,359
and me.

597
00:32:23,359 --> 00:32:25,519
I think I forgot to tell you something.

598
00:32:27,279 --> 00:32:28,759
Your favorite son,

599
00:32:29,039 --> 00:32:30,079
Cheng Feng.

600
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:33,599
His death wasn't an accident.
